1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,358
Welcome back!

2
00:00:01,358 --> 00:00:05,117
Staring at a blank page is
the slowest part of marketing.

3
00:00:05,117 --> 00:00:09,999
In this lesson, you'll use Content AI
to write an email and a social post,

4
00:00:09,999 --> 00:00:12,637
and create images, in just a few clicks.

5
00:00:13,489 --> 00:00:15,909
Go to AI Agents, then Content AI.

6
00:00:15,909 --> 00:00:19,723
You'll also see Content AI
inside the email builder,

7
00:00:19,723 --> 00:00:22,143
the social planner and your blog.

8
00:00:22,143 --> 00:00:23,830
On Pro, it's unlimited.

9
00:00:23,830 --> 00:00:27,717
On other plans, it's billed
at $0.18 per 1,000 words,

10
00:00:27,717 --> 00:00:30,797
so a typical email costs less than a cent.

11
00:00:31,648 --> 00:00:36,378
First, choose what you're writing:
an email, a social post, a blog post,

12
00:00:36,378 --> 00:00:38,480
website copy, or a text message.

13
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:43,736
Bloom wants to email past patients about
a whitening offer, so we'll pick Email.

14
00:00:44,585 --> 00:00:46,236
Now describe what you want.

15
00:00:46,236 --> 00:00:50,272
Be specific: who it's for, the
offer, the price, and the deadline.

16
00:00:50,272 --> 00:00:53,207
The more detail you give,
the better the result.

17
00:00:54,057 --> 00:00:55,470
Pick a tone of voice.

18
00:00:55,470 --> 00:00:57,421
Friendly suits Bloom's brand.

19
00:00:57,421 --> 00:00:58,834
Then choose a length.

20
00:00:58,834 --> 00:01:00,987
Medium is right for most emails.

21
00:01:00,987 --> 00:01:05,966
Professional works well for clinical
topics, and Playful for social media.

22
00:01:05,966 --> 00:01:06,975
Click Generate.

23
00:01:07,826 --> 00:01:12,983
And there it is, written in seconds: a
subject line, a warm opening, the offer,

24
00:01:12,983 --> 00:01:14,746
the deadline, and a button.

25
00:01:14,746 --> 00:01:19,381
Notice the first name field, so every
patient gets a personal greeting.

26
00:01:20,230 --> 00:01:24,799
Content AI gives you a strong first
draft, but you know your patients best.

27
00:01:24,799 --> 00:01:27,905
Always read it through,
and make it sound like you.

28
00:01:27,905 --> 00:01:28,880
Not quite right?

29
00:01:28,880 --> 00:01:31,134
Click Regenerate for a fresh version.

30
00:01:31,134 --> 00:01:36,068
When you're happy, click Use in email
campaign to drop it straight into the email

31
00:01:36,068 --> 00:01:36,555
builder.

32
00:01:37,405 --> 00:01:38,929
Let's try a social post.

33
00:01:38,929 --> 00:01:43,881
Choose Social post, describe it, and
pick Short, because short posts get read.

34
00:01:43,881 --> 00:01:48,960
Click Generate, and you get a short post
with emojis and a clear call to action.

35
00:01:49,809 --> 00:01:54,539
Click Send to Social Planner, and you can
schedule it to Instagram and Facebook.

36
00:01:54,539 --> 00:01:57,613
We cover the social planner
in the marketing module.

37
00:01:58,469 --> 00:02:00,590
Content AI creates images, too.

38
00:02:00,590 --> 00:02:04,558
Open the Image tab, and describe
what you need: the scene,

39
00:02:04,558 --> 00:02:08,799
the lighting and the mood, just
as you'd brief a photographer.

40
00:02:08,799 --> 00:02:10,646
Choose a style, and a size.

41
00:02:10,646 --> 00:02:12,767
Portrait suits Instagram posts.

42
00:02:13,625 --> 00:02:16,120
Click Generate, and you get four options.

43
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:19,224
Pick your favourite, then
save it to Media Storage,

44
00:02:19,224 --> 00:02:21,414
or add it straight to a social post.

45
00:02:25,310 --> 00:02:30,155
Finally, the History tab keeps everything
you've generated, and where you used it,

46
00:02:30,155 --> 00:02:33,286
so you can always find that
great subject line again.

47
00:02:33,286 --> 00:02:36,949
It's also a quick way to see
what worked before, and reuse it.

48
00:02:37,798 --> 00:02:38,939
Here's a pro tip.

49
00:02:38,939 --> 00:02:41,893
AI writes best when you
give it the details.

50
00:02:41,893 --> 00:02:46,390
Always include who it's for, the
offer, the price and the deadline.

51
00:02:46,390 --> 00:02:50,484
And only use AI images that
honestly represent your business.

52
00:02:51,333 --> 00:02:53,427
You're writing faster than ever!

53
00:02:53,427 --> 00:02:58,794
In the final lesson of this module, we'll
put AI inside your automations, to sort,

54
00:02:58,794 --> 00:03:01,412
summarise and reply to messages for you.

55
00:03:01,412 --> 00:03:02,328
See you there.
